特質，出色的領袖都擁有！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230803/763841448877625344820971.jpeg/e-weyG02F594VQL8bIYR4o2USpqLMdV0uYX-2rmF_to\"/><figcaption>管理技巧｜這5項特質，出色的領袖都擁有！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「經理人」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T08:20:01.789022+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":3910,"images":86,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T08:00:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T09:17:46.496948+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T08:17:42.341031+00:00","content_hash":"4dc55e944f4ea59966524a657bf3661c493a2d1e2ddd4938ca49e859323e6daa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}